   293→    tags:
   294→      - mvp
   295→      - meta
   296→      - workflows
   297→    description: |
   298→      Workflows are structured process definitions. They capture the
   299→      steps agents should follow for specific triggers. Unlike prose
   300→      documentation, workflows can be queried and validated.
   301→
   302→      Workflows are trackable - tasks can reference them via --meta-ref
   303→      to track work on improving the workflow itself.
   304→    acceptance_criteria:
   305→      - id: ac-workflow-1
