   450→        description: |
   451→          Triggers are freeform strings describing when workflow applies:
   452→
   453→          - "behavior change" - Implementing new/modified behavior
   454→          - "session start" - Beginning a work session
   455→          - "task complete" - Finishing a task
   456→          - "bug fix" - Fixing a defect
   457→
   458→          Triggers are documentation, not automation.
   459→          Agents decide when workflows apply based on context.
   460→        implements:
   461→          - '@workflow-definitions'
   462→        created: '2026-01-17T05:46:34.849Z'
