   519→        description: |
   520→          Convention definition structure:
   521→
   522→          ```yaml
   523→          - _ulid: 01KF...
   524→            domain: commits       # Area this convention covers
   525→            rules:
   526→              - Use conventional commit format
   527→              - Reference task in commit body when applicable
   528→              - Keep subject line under 72 characters
