   541→      - _ulid: 01KF1XCNV20000000000000000
   542→        slugs:
   543→          - convention-domains
   544→        title: Convention Domains
   545→        type: requirement
   546→        status:
   547→          maturity: draft
   548→          implementation: not_started
   549→        description: |
   550→          Standard convention domains:
   551→
   552→          - commits: Git commit message format
   553→          - notes: Task note writing style
   554→          - naming: Slug/identifier conventions
   555→          - tags: Tag taxonomy and usage
   556→          - branching: Git branch naming
