   895→
   896→          ```yaml
   897→          # .kspec-session (gitignored)
   898→          focus: "@task-meta-spec"    # Current work focus
   899→          threads:                     # Active conversation threads
   900→            - "Designing observation promotion flow"
   901→            - "Deciding on context persistence"
   902→          open_questions:              # Unresolved questions
   903→            - "Should conventions be auto-validated?"
   904→            - "How to handle cross-project inheritance?"
