   919→          implementation: not_started
   920→        description: |
   921→          Context is stored in .kspec-session:
   922→
   923→          - Separate from meta manifest (ephemeral vs stable)
   924→          - Gitignored by default (session-specific)
   925→          - Auto-created when context commands used
   926→          - Can be deleted without losing project configuration
   927→
   928→          This keeps project-level meta (agents, workflows) separate
   929→          from session-level state (focus, threads).
