  1415→        description: |
  1416→          Tasks gain meta_ref field parallel to spec_ref:
  1417→
  1418→          ```yaml
  1419→          - _ulid: 01KF...
  1420→            title: Simplify spec-first for trivial changes
  1421→            type: task
  1422→            meta_ref: "@workflow-spec-first"
  1423→            status: pending
  1424→            ...
  1425→          ```
  1426→
  1427→          meta_ref points to workflow, agent, or convention.
  1428→          Enables queries like "what tasks improve this workflow?"
