  1463→        description: |
  1464→          Query tasks by meta_ref:
  1465→
  1466→          ```bash
  1467→          kspec tasks list --meta-ref @workflow-spec-first
  1468→          ```
  1469→
  1470→          Returns all tasks linked to that workflow.
  1471→          Useful for tracking improvement progress.
